OL,3,GNEWSAThe AI photo shortcut experts say
OL,4,Aparents should avoid
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts are urging parents to think
OL,7,Fcarefully before uploading photographs
OL,8,Fof their children to artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) tools, amid concerns
OL,10,Fover how images could be stored, reused
OL,11,For shared.
OL,13,FThe warning comes as some parents have
OL,14,Fbeen using AI to remove watermarks from
OL,15,Fschool photos to avoid paying for them.
OL,17,FWhile specialists say AI can bring
OL,18,Fbenefits, they urge families to check
OL,19,Fhow platforms handle uploaded images
OL,20,Fand whether photographs may be used to
OL,21,Ftrain AI models.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
