OL,3,GNEWSAThe AI photo shortcut experts say
OL,4,Aparents should avoid
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not about avoiding AI
OL,7,Faltogether," said George Martin,
OL,8,Fsecurity and data protection adviser at
OL,9,FSouth West Grid for Learning. "It's
OL,10,Fabout understanding what happens to
OL,11,Fthose images once they've been
OL,12,Fuploaded."
